# The repository stores and checks out LF everywhere. Spotless (Java), Prettier (frontend), and ruff format
# (Python) all normalise to LF, so a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true would otherwise see every file
# as modified after a formatter run and fail format:check locally while CI passes.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
